# LenaRise.SlopGuard — this repository's own exemption
#
# This repository is a testing tool, and its tests are the product's verification
# mechanism: it cannot be developed without writing them. A repository-scoped
# exemption was chosen over the global allowTestWrites, so the lock stays on in
# every other project.
#
# It is also the consistent decision: the runtime does not scan test paths either
# (pre-edit's TEST lock refuses to write there, so post-edit never sees a test
# file), and scripts/selfscan.mjs keeps test paths outside the scanned surface
# for the same reason.
test
node_modules
